    <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-intro">Seascape Vacations collects the contact details needed to process bookings and answer guest or owner questions. The site also uses limited analytics to understand what pages and booking paths are working.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container legal-shell">
